</div>
<canvas id="tv" aria-label="A chain of numbered routers between you and a server. A packet moves along it."></canvas>
<p class="info" id="t-info"></p>
<div class="tpad"><ul class="term" id="t-out"></ul>
<p class="note">Stars mean a router didn’t answer. Some are set to ignore these probes. Your data still passes through them fine.</p></div>
